images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-74ca4aaac95fb249END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-153edd4d90f02796END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_Alchemy_SerpentVenom</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_Alchemy_SerpentVenom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_Alchemy_SerpentVenom\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">32d92bb6-23f4-43bf-a979-8cf895479853</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:32d92bb6-23f4-43bf-a979-8cf895479853\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:32d92bb6-23f4-43bf-a979-8cf895479853\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a locked wooden chest in the back room of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Waning_Moon\" title=\"The Waning Moon\">The Waning Moon</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-258&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-94</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>WOULD YOU LIKE TO KNOW SOMETHING INTERESTING\n</p><p>IF YOU MIX <a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Snake_Venom\" title=\"Suspension of Snake Venom\">SUSPENSION OF VENOMOUS FANG</a> WITH <a href=\"/wiki/Vitriol_of_Lolth%27s_Candle\" title=\"Vitriol of Lolth's Candle\">VITRIOL OF LOLTHS CANDLE</a> (ANY <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">VITRIOL</a> WILL DO!) OUT COMES A <a href=\"/wiki/Serpent_Fang_Toxin\" title=\"Serpent Fang Toxin\">POISON</a> DRIPDRIPDRIP\n</p><p><br>\nwhen in doubt with alchemy\n</p><p>when in need of ecstacy\n</p><p>when my throat clicks with scream\n</p><p>dripdripdrip is what I dream\n</p><p><br>\nit did not work the platinum scale plan did not work and i hurt so badly\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714225422\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1966/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34050/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9885/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936400/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.280      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   52.280      1 -total\n 42.48%   22.207      7 Template:Icon_text\n 40.44%   21.140     23 Template:Trim\n 38.87%   20.323      1 Template:PageSeo\n 38.74%   20.251      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 29.28%   15.307      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 19.98%   10.443      2 Template:Uid\n 16.55%    8.651      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.79%    6.164      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idh